
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ko">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <title>나의 식물 관리</title>

    <style>
        body {
            background-color: beige;
            text-align: center;
            font-family: Arial;
            color: darkgreen;
        }

        h1 {
            margin-top: 50px;
        }

        .plant {
            background-color: white;
            width: 250px;
            margin: 30px auto;
            padding: 20px;
            border-radius: 20px;
        }

        img {
            width: 200px;
            height: 180px;
            object-fit: cover;
            border-radius: 15px;
        }

        p {
            color: seagreen;
        }

        button {
            background-color: lightgreen;
            color: darkgreen;
            border: none;
            padding: 10px 15px;
            border-radius: 10px;
            cursor: pointer;
        }
    </style>
</head>

<body>

    <h1>🌿 우니 정원이얌</h1>

    <div class="plant">

        <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1501004318641-b39e6451bec6?w=500">

        <h2>몬스테라</h2>

        <p id="status1">잘 크고 이떵💚!</p>

        <button onclick="status1.innerHTML='휴우 고마워 💚!'">
            💧 물 주기
        </button>

    </div>

    <div class="plant">

        <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1497250681960-ef046c08a56e?w=500">

        <h2>스투키</h2>

        <p id="status2">물 줘 ㅠㅠ 💧</p>

        <button onclick="status2.innerHTML='휴우 고마워 💚!'">
            💧 물 주기
        </button>

    </div>

</body>
</html>
